10962|NTAP|2026-05-29|historical_scan|HIGH|96.0|24.08|strong|HIGH|floor||1.00|09:35|Historical scan: 24.1% gap, 7.6x rvol||Real, verifiable catalyst: record Q4/FY26 results (+12% YoY rev, record all-flash/Public Cloud) plus a fresh $1.0B buyback — a broad-based earnings beat, not boilerplate. At a $31B cap this is material but not transformative, and it joins no active drone/nuclear narrative cohort, so it stays strong rather than game_changer. The 24% gap on a clean concrete catalyst supports holding HIGH at the strong grade.|NetApp reported Q4 FY2026 results with net revenue of $1.95B (+12% YoY) and full-year revenue of $6.93B (+5% YoY), with record results across revenue, gross profit, operating income, and free cash flow — a clear and verifiable earnings beat. The company also announced a new $1.0B share repurchase authorization, and highlighted record all-flash array revenue of $1.2B (+18% YoY) and record Public Cloud revenue of $182M (+11% YoY). While the beat is solid and broad-based with positive AI-driven momentum commentary, NTAP is a $31B large-cap, which tempers the classification from game_changer; this is a strong, well-executed quarter with capital return upside but not a transformative, paradigm-shifting event.|[SEC 8-K filed 2026-05-28, items 2.02,8.01,9.01] 8-K false 0001002047 0001002047 2026-05-21 2026-05-21 UNITED STATES SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION WASHINGTON, D.C. 20549 FORM 8-K CURRENT REPORT Pursuant to Section 13 or 15(d) of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 Date of Report (Date of earliest event reported): May 21, 2026 NetApp, Inc. (Exact name of Registrant as Specified in Its Charter) Delaware 0-27130 77-0307520 (State or Other Jurisdiction of Incorporation) (Commission File Number) (IRS Employer Identification No.) 3060 Olsen Drive San Jose , California 95128 (Address of Principal Executive Offices) (Zip Code) Registrant&#8217;s Telephone Number, Including Area Code: (408) 822-6000 (Former Name or Former Address, if Changed Since