10986|NVTX|2026-06-03|historical_scan|HIGH|62.4|37.69|routine|none|floor||1.00|09:35|Historical scan: 37.7% gap, 5.4x rvol||NVTX is a 2X leveraged daily ETF whose gap is purely a derivative reflection of the underlying's daily move, with no company-specific catalyst of its own. There is no real, material event — no earnings, contract, or policy — so the gap+volume is just mechanical leverage, not a tradeable EP catalyst. Demote below the MODERATE floor since the move carries no independent narrative or theme membership.|NVTX is a 2X leveraged daily ETF tracking NVTS (Nvni Group / Navitas Semiconductor or similar), meaning any gap-up is purely a derivative move driven by the underlying stock's performance — not a company-specific catalyst for NVTX itself. No news was found for NVTX, and no concrete, verifiable catalyst (earnings, FDA decision, contract, upgrade) exists. The gap-up is entirely explained by leveraged exposure to the underlying ticker's daily move, which is a non-company-specific technical/sector momentum event.|
